-- הוראת תכ"ם 13.4.2 "תשלום קצובת נסיעה", מהדורה 11 (2.5.2025)
-- Edition 11 of the Accountant-General's travel-allowance instruction. Its
-- change table names one change, "חידוד ההנחיה בדבר קצובת נסעה לעובד
-- עיוור": the blind employee's allowance "is not subject to the monthly
-- cap of section 2.3.4". Every other clause is edition 10's, word for word,
-- and is taken from that file by import.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `kitzuvat-nesia-common`
IMPORT `taarifei-nesia-common`
IMPORT `taarifei-nesia-in-force-common`
IMPORT `2025-05-01_takam_H-13-4-2_kitzuvat-nesia_v10`

-- Tariffs: the notice's (`travel fares`, read off the notice in force by
-- `the travel allowance on the route` below). No rule here rounds
-- (convention rounding.default).

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘משרה מלאה’ here is
-- the blind employee's basis for the allowance (five times the monthly
-- ticket, 2.3.7), not the hours of work and rest.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: ‘בעל’ here is the holder of a
-- post or of a service or assigned car (‘בעל רכב צמוד’, ‘בעל נהג צמוד’),
-- not a husband; the instruction sets one travel allowance for every
-- employee, man or woman, and does not distinguish between them.

-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: ‘חודש סיום העסקה’ here is a
-- month in which the travel allowance is paid pro rata (2.1.5), not notice
-- of dismissal or resignation.

§ `הוראת תכ"ם 13.4.2 תשלום קצובת נסיעה — מהדורה 11`

§§ `1 מבוא`

-- 1.1, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1
GIVEN `employed by a government ministry or an auxiliary unit` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `edition 11 applies to` `employed by a government ministry or an auxiliary unit` IF
    `edition 10 applies to` `employed by a government ministry or an auxiliary unit`

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 Further payments in Eilat and the Negev are the notice "תשלומים לנוסעים / עובדים באילת ותוספת ערבה", which the corpus does not hold; no rule here.
-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3/p2 The instruction's purpose; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-4 A pointer to annex A, whose definitions the rules below cite; no rule.

§§ `2.1 זכאות לקצובת נסיעה`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 The heading "זכאות לקצובת נסיעה"; its clauses follow.

-- 2.1.1, 2.2.1 and its cases, annex A's definitions 1 and 7, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_7 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-4 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1
GIVEN m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the travel allowance, edition 11` m IF
    `entitled to the travel allowance, edition 10` m

-- 2.1.2 and annex A's definition 4, as in edition 10: one residence.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_4
`the residences the allowance is paid from, edition 11` MEANS `the residences the allowance is paid from, edition 10`

-- 2.1.3, as in edition 10: one single trip a week from the workplace to the
-- permanent home, in addition.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3
`the trips home a week, edition 11` MEANS `the trips home a week, edition 10`

-- 2.1.4-2.1.6 and annex A's definitions 2-3, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-4
`the refund depends on the frequency of transport or the hours of work, edition 11` MEANS
    `the refund depends on the frequency of transport or the hours of work, edition 10`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-5 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-5__pnt_2-1-5-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-5__pnt_2-1-5-2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_3
GIVEN f IS A `travel fares`, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the monthly employee's allowance, edition 11` f m IS
    `the monthly employee's allowance, edition 10` f m

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-6
GIVEN amount IS A NUMBER, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the partial allowance for a partial State-funded month, edition 11` amount m IS
    `the partial allowance for a partial State-funded month, edition 10` amount m

§§ `2.3 קביעת זכאות לקצובת נסיעה בעקבות רפורמת דרך שווה`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 The heading; its clauses follow.

-- 2.3.1-2.3.3, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-2
`the train is refunded with every other means of public transport, edition 11` MEANS
    `the train is refunded with every other means of public transport, edition 10`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-3
GIVEN m IS A `travel month`, `the equalisation the notice sets` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the travel-allowance equalisation, edition 11` m `the equalisation the notice sets` IS
    `the travel-allowance equalisation, edition 10` m `the equalisation the notice sets`

-- 2.3.4, as in edition 10: a cap of 1,330 shekels a month.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-4
`the monthly cap, edition 11` MEANS `the monthly cap, edition 10`

-- 2.3.5-2.3.6 and annex A's definition 5, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-5 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-5/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-6 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-6/p2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_5
GIVEN f IS A `travel fares`, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance for travel to work, edition 11` f m IS
    `the allowance for travel to work, edition 10` f m

-- 2.3.7 and annex A's definition 6: five monthly tickets in a full
-- position, five times the daily tickets for the days travelled by the
-- hour (no more than five monthly tickets), cancelling every other
-- entitlement, and now in terms "not subject to the monthly cap of section
-- 2.3.4" — the reading editions 9 and 10 were given.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-7 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-7/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-7/p3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-7/p4 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_6
GIVEN f IS A `travel fares`, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the blind employee's allowance, edition 11` f m IS
    `the blind employee's allowance, edition 10` f m

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-7/p4
`the blind employee's allowance is subject to the monthly cap, edition 11` MEANS FALSE

-- 2.3.8, as in edition 10: 128 shekels a month in addition.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-8 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-8/p2
GIVEN m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement for a locality without public transport, edition 11` m IS
    `the supplement for a locality without public transport, edition 10` m

§§ `2.4 קצובה בגין נסיעה בשבתות וחגים`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4 The heading; its clauses follow.

-- 2.4.1-2.4.3, as in edition 10.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-4__cls_2-4-3
GIVEN f IS A `travel fares`, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance within the payment cap, edition 11` f m IS
    `the allowance within the payment cap, edition 10` f m

-- The month's allowance, as edition 10 builds it; the blind employee's,
-- in place of every other, outside the cap.
GIVEN f IS A `travel fares`, m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the travel allowance, edition 11` f m IS
    IF NOT `entitled to the travel allowance, edition 11` m THEN 0
    ELSE CONSIDER `the blind employee's allowance, edition 11` f m
         WHEN JUST b THEN b
         WHEN NOTHING THEN
                 `the allowance within the payment cap, edition 11` f m
            PLUS `the supplement for a locality without public transport, edition 11` m
            PLUS `the weekly trips to the permanent home` f m `the trips home a week, edition 11`

