@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-7__cls_2-7-2
GIVEN allowance IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `travel-allowance duty`
DECIDE `grossing up the tax, edition 11` allowance IS
    `grossing up the tax, edition 10` allowance

§§ `3-4 מסמכים ישימים ונספחים`

-- akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-2 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-3 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-4 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-5 The applicable documents (the takshir's chapters 28.3 and 16.6, the form, the two notices); a source list, no rule.
-- akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-1 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-2 The list of annexes; no rule.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 Annex A's title "הגדרות"; its definitions are cited by the rules that use them.
-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1/p2 akn:att_2__hc_1/t1 Annex B, the table of the editions' changes; a record, no rule.

§§ `התעריפים — the notice in force`

-- The edition reads the monthly free pass and the daily free pass, the single fare; here they are read off the notice
-- "לוח תעריפי נסיעה בתחבורה ציבורית" in force on the month's day (HOD
-- 13.4.2.1, `taarifei-nesia-in-force-common`), for the employee's route. Where
-- the notice prints no tariff the edition reads, there is no answer.
GIVEN r IS A `travel route`, d IS A DATE @desc the month's day
      m IS A `travel month`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the travel allowance on the route, edition 11` r d m IS
    CONSIDER `the travel fares of the route on` r d TRUE TRUE FALSE
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST f THEN JUST (`the travel allowance, edition 11` f m)

-- The equalisation supplement the notice in force sets, on the route's
-- monthly free pass.
GIVEN r IS A `travel route`, d IS A DATE
      m IS A `travel month`
      x IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance paid before the reform, every component included
      `the highest allowance of 2022` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the travel-allowance equalisation on the route, edition 11` r d m x `the highest allowance of 2022` IS
    CONSIDER `the tariffs of the route on` r d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST rt THEN
        CONSIDER rt's `route monthly pass`
        WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
        WHEN JUST monthly THEN
            CONSIDER `the equalisation supplement in force on` d x monthly `the highest allowance of 2022`
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING
            WHEN JUST s THEN JUST (`the travel-allowance equalisation, edition 11` m s)

§§ `Worked examples`

`an expensive route, edition 11` MEANS
    `travel fares` WITH
        `monthly free pass`     IS 1200
        `daily free pass`       IS 60
        `single fare`           IS 30
        `intercity single fare` IS 0

-- 2.3.4: a monthly ticket of 1,200 with four Sabbath days (480), capped.
`a month with four Sabbaths, edition 11` MEANS
    `the travel month changed` (`an ordinary travel month` `a monthly employee` 22) TRUE FALSE 4 FALSE FALSE 0 0
#ASSERT `the travel allowance, edition 11` `an expensive route, edition 11` `a month with four Sabbaths, edition 11` EQUALS 1330

-- 2.3.7: a blind employee in a full position on that route, five tickets,
-- not capped.
`a blind full-time employee's month, edition 11` MEANS
    `the travel month changed` (`an ordinary travel month` `a monthly employee` 22) TRUE TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0
#ASSERT `the travel allowance, edition 11` `an expensive route, edition 11` `a blind full-time employee's month, edition 11` EQUALS 6000

-- 2.3.7: a blind hourly employee of 10 days, five times 600, under five
-- monthly tickets.
`a blind hourly employee's month, edition 11` MEANS
    `the travel month changed` (`an ordinary travel month` `an employee paid by the hour` 10) TRUE TRUE 0 FALSE FALSE 0 0
#ASSERT `the travel allowance, edition 11` `an expensive route, edition 11` `a blind hourly employee's month, edition 11` EQUALS 3000

-- 2.2.1.2: an employee with an assigned car is paid nothing.
`a month with an assigned car, edition 11` MEANS
    `travel month` WITH
        `kind of employee`                                  IS `a monthly employee`
        `needs transport from home to work`                 IS TRUE
        `a full month of work`                              IS TRUE
        `days actually worked`                              IS 22
        `share of trips by a State-funded arrangement`      IS 0
        `has an assigned car`                               IS TRUE
        `has an assigned driver`                            IS FALSE
        `has a service or personal car`                     IS TRUE
        `absent a calendar month or more`                   IS FALSE
        `blind`                                             IS FALSE
        `in a full position`                                IS TRUE
        `lives where there is no public transport`          IS FALSE
        `Sabbath and holiday days reached`                  IS 0
        `the office runs a shuttle`                         IS FALSE
        `lives in a national-priority locality`             IS FALSE
        `travels on lines with a monthly pass`              IS TRUE
        `travels intercity individually`                    IS FALSE
        `relocated 70 km or more as an Arab, Druze or Circassian employee` IS FALSE
        `weeks with a trip to the permanent home`           IS 0
        `days worked a week`                                IS 5
        `taken into the State service by 31.7.2022`         IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the travel allowance, edition 11` `an expensive route, edition 11` `a month with an assigned car, edition 11` EQUALS 0

-- On 1.6.2025, a monthly employee of 22 days on `a 30 km route` (the
-- Tel Aviv codes before the reform, 30 km by bus after it): the edition's
-- allowance on the tariffs the notice in force prints.
#ASSERT `the travel allowance on the route, edition 11` `a 30 km route` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2025) (`an ordinary travel month` `a monthly employee` 22) EQUALS
    JUST (`the travel allowance, edition 11` `the route's fares on 1.6.2025, edition 11` (`an ordinary travel month` `a monthly employee` 22))

`the route's fares on 1.6.2025, edition 11` MEANS
    `travel fares` WITH
        `monthly free pass`     IS 323
        `daily free pass`       IS 32.5
        `single fare`           IS 14.5
        `intercity single fare` IS 0
